{
  "name": "dsh-portable-workspace",
  "version": "0.1.5",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "移动工作区：把 DSH 会话、插件、工程与交付完整运行在移动硬盘 / U 盘上。①完全自包含 100% 不落本地。移动便携工作，不惧换电脑，不惧重装系统；②独立便携 web 实例。可多开实例，独立插件配置环境；③盘符无关识别 + 脱机；④scrypt 密码 + 一次性恢复密钥 + 密码提示 + 查看型入口先验密码；⑤缺插件一键装 / 短名解析 / 兼容预检 / 按清单重装；⑥跨盘·本机会话双向迁移 + .zip 备份恢复 + 改名；⑦升级友好零依赖离线可用。",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "author": "AlecWong",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "portable-workspace",
    "removable-drive",
    "usb",
    "移动工作区",
    "plugin"
  ],
  "homepage": "https://pwp.rooj.top/",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Alec6636/dsh-portable-workspace.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://pwp.rooj.top/"
  },
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "lib/*.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "scripts/*.mjs",
    "docs/",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.5"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar"
      ]
    }
  }
}
